WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.400
Sign in. Sign in to your invited account. This walkthrough uses a demo account, never your private data.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:15.040
App footage: Sign in

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:21.840
Set up your workspace. Enter your setup name, usual basket dose and the grind settings you use for espresso.

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:29.120
App footage: Set up your workspace

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:35.600
Add your coffee. Enter the coffee name and roaster. You can also paste an official product URL for autofill.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:42.200
App footage: Add your coffee

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:48.680
Choose a shot style. Open a coffee card and review its starting recipe. Choose the style you want to brew.

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:56.200
App footage: Choose a shot style

00:00:56.200 --> 00:01:02.520
Log your measurements. Record your actual dose, yield, shot time and grind setting. Yield and time begin blank.

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:07.320
App footage: Log your measurements

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:14.320
Rate the five taste scales. Rate Extraction, Body, Clarity, Sweetness and Dryness. Every rating is required.

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:22.680
App footage: Rate the five taste scales

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:29.480
Get your next-shot advice. After you save, the app shows feedback and one intentional adjustment to try next.

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:35.880
App footage: Get your next-shot advice

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:42.280
What “Dialed In” looks like. When all five taste ratings are green, the shot contributes to your successful recipe window.

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:47.920
App footage: What “Dialed In” looks like

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:54.920
Explore your Shot History. Expand earlier shots to compare measurements, ratings, tasting notes and the radar chart.

00:01:54.920 --> 00:02:05.720
App footage: Explore your Shot History

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:12.320
Better espresso. One shot at a time. Keep tasting, logging and adjusting. Need help? support@dialincollective.com

00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:15.560
App footage: Better espresso. One shot at a time.
